      "message": "Yes, this was an option I initially considered. However, the expansion of these macros blows up the size of the function. Specially after adding all the new logs. Whereas using this function actually reduces the size with this patch.\n\nI could alternative switch to `int debug_mask` here instead and do the following if it makes more sense:\n```\n#define binder_txn_error(x...) \\\n        binder_transaction_error(BINDER_DEBUG_FAILED_TRANSACTION, x)\n#define binder_user_txn_error(x...) \\\n        binder_transaction_error(BINDER_DEBUG_USER_ERROR, x)\n```",
